        <p>「お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29994-30009"><rb>礼</rb><rt>れい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30009-30012">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30012-30036"><rb>申上</rb><rt>まをしあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30036-30063">げます、――あのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30063-30081"><rb>薬</rb><rt>くすり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30081-30102">のためだらうと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30102-30117"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30117-30132">ひます。五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30132-30147"><rb>日</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30147-30171"><rb>以上</rb><rt>いじやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30171-30177">……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30177-30198"><rb>滋養</rb><rt>じやう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30198-30228"><rb>灌腸</rb><rt>くわんちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30228-30240">なぞは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30240-30264"><rb>絶対</rb><rt>ぜつたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30264-30267">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30267-30282"><rb>嫌</rb><rt>きら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30282-30300">ひますから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30300-30321"><rb>湯水</rb><rt>ゆみづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30321-30324">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30324-30339"><rb>通</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30339-30372">らないくらゐですのに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30372-30393"><rb>意識</rb><rt>いしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30393-30396">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30396-30420"><rb>明瞭</rb><rt>めいれう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30420-30426">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30426-30450"><rb>今朝</rb><rt>こんてう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-