        <p>「さあ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45456-45471"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45471-45474">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45474-45486"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45486-45507">はうかな。……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45507-45528"><rb>景色</rb><rt>けしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45528-45531">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45531-45543"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45543-45555">うだ、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45555-45567"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45567-45576">かれて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45576-45591"><rb>悪</rb><rt>わる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45591-45597">いと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45597-45609"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45609-45642">ふものもなからうし……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45642-45657"><rb>唯</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45657-45693">よかつたよ、とだけぢや、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45693-45708"><rb>君</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45708-45717">たちの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45717-45732"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45732-45735">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45735-45753"><rb>納</rb><rt>をさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45753-45777">るまいけれども、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45777-45792"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45792-45801">しろ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45801-45819"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45819-45828">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45828-45852"><rb>松島</rb><rt>まつしま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45852-45855">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45855-45867"><rb>見</rb>