 source="#source-46260-46272"><rb>湯</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46272-46275">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46275-46290"><rb>入</rb><rt>はひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46290-46296">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46296-46308"><rb>寝</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby>るばかりさ。」</p>
