        <p><seg source="#source-46528-46531">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46531-46543"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46543-46561">があけたわ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46561-46576"><rb>顔</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46576-46579">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46579-46594"><rb>洗</rb><rt>あら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46594-46606">つたわ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46606-46633"><rb>旅館</rb><rt>りよくわん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46633-46636">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46636-46660"><rb>縁側</rb><rt>えんがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46660-46669">から、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46669-46693"><rb>築山</rb><rt>つきやま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46693-46696">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46696-46711"><rb>松</rb><rt>まつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46711-46714">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46714-46726"><rb>生</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46726-46738">へたのが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46738-46753"><rb>幾</rb><rt>いく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46753-46759">つも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46759-46777"><rb>霞</rb><rt>かすみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46777-46780">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46780-46795"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46795-46798">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46798-46810"><rb>浮</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46810-46816">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46816-46828"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46828-46834">る、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46834-46852"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46852-46855">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46855-46870